WEBVTT

00:00:06.388 --> 00:00:10.494
[Po groans]
What's going on?

00:00:10.624 --> 00:00:12.888
Where, uh...?

00:00:15.064 --> 00:00:16.935
What are you pointing...?

00:00:18.328 --> 00:00:19.459
Oh!

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:21.374
OK. Sorry.

00:00:21.505 --> 00:00:24.029
I just wanted to see
who the Dragon Warrior was.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.031
How interesting.

00:00:26.162 --> 00:00:29.339
Master, are you
pointing at me?

00:00:29.469 --> 00:00:33.386
- Him.
- Who?

00:00:33.517 --> 00:00:35.693
- You.
- Me?

00:00:35.823 --> 00:00:41.481
The universe has brought us
the Dragon Warrior!

00:00:41.612 --> 00:00:42.961
- What?
- [both] What?!

00:00:43.092 --> 00:00:44.920
- What?!
- What?!

00:00:46.225 --> 00:00:49.359
[up-tempo music plays]

00:00:54.712 --> 00:00:57.193
Stop, wait! Who told you to...?

00:01:03.416 --> 00:01:05.941
[straining]

00:01:06.071 --> 00:01:08.291
Master Oogway, wait.

00:01:08.421 --> 00:01:12.556
That flabby panda can't possibly
be the answer to our problem.

00:01:12.686 --> 00:01:16.342
You were about to point at
Tigress, and that thing
fell in front of her!

00:01:16.473 --> 00:01:17.822
That was just
an accident!

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:21.217
There are no accidents.

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:22.740
[grunting]

00:01:26.091 --> 00:01:27.571
[straining]

00:01:35.709 --> 00:01:38.538
Forgive us, Master.
We have failed you.

00:01:38.669 --> 00:01:41.889
No. If the panda
has not quit by morning

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:44.544
then I will have failed you.

00:01:48.809 --> 00:01:51.421
[Zeng] Oh! Ahh! Oh! Oooh!

00:02:02.736 --> 00:02:05.391
Wait! Wait, wait, wait!
I bring a message...

00:02:05.522 --> 00:02:07.915
...from Master Shifu.

00:02:12.485 --> 00:02:14.835
What?! "Double the guard?!"

00:02:14.966 --> 00:02:16.837
"Extra precautions?!"

00:02:16.968 --> 00:02:19.318
"Your prison may not
be adequate?!"

00:02:19.449 --> 00:02:21.016
[chuckling nervously]

00:02:22.495 --> 00:02:25.803
You doubt
my prison security?!

00:02:25.933 --> 00:02:27.761
Absolutely not.

00:02:27.892 --> 00:02:30.851
Shifu does.
I'm just the messenger.

00:02:30.982 --> 00:02:35.204
I'll give you a message
for your Master Shifu.

00:02:35.334 --> 00:02:38.598
Escape from Chorh-Gom prison
is impossible!

00:02:40.905 --> 00:02:43.603
- Oooh!
- [laughter]

00:02:43.734 --> 00:02:46.737
Impressive, isn't it?

00:02:46.867 --> 00:02:49.957
It's very impressive.
It's very impressive.

00:02:50.088 --> 00:02:52.612
One way in, one way out.

00:02:52.743 --> 00:02:56.834
One thousand guards
and one prisoner.

00:02:56.964 --> 00:02:59.489
Yes, except
that prisoner...

00:02:59.619 --> 00:03:01.360
...is Tai Lung.

00:03:05.277 --> 00:03:07.192
Take us down.

00:03:12.545 --> 00:03:17.898
- What are you doing?
- [laughing]

00:03:25.254 --> 00:03:26.690
Oh, my.

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:29.997
- [chains clanking]
- [chuckling nervously]

00:03:30.998 --> 00:03:34.219
[man] Behold Tai Lung.

00:03:35.829 --> 00:03:38.832
I'll, um...
I'm just gonna wait right here.

00:03:38.963 --> 00:03:42.923
It's nothing to worry about.
It's perfectly safe.

00:03:43.054 --> 00:03:47.363
- Crossbows! At the ready!
- Crossbows?

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:49.974
Hey, tough guy,
did you hear?

00:03:50.105 --> 00:03:53.064
Oogway's finally gonna
give someone the Dragon Scroll,

00:03:53.195 --> 00:03:54.587
and it's not gonna be you.

00:03:54.718 --> 00:03:56.676
What are you doing?
Don't get him mad.

00:03:56.807 --> 00:03:58.330
What's he
gonna do about it?

00:03:58.461 --> 00:04:01.333
I've got him
completely immobilized.

00:04:02.987 --> 00:04:05.468
[laughing] Oh!

00:04:05.598 --> 00:04:09.428
Did I step on the
wittle kitty's tail? Aw.

00:04:09.559 --> 00:04:11.256
I'm good. I've seen enough.

00:04:11.387 --> 00:04:13.519
I'll tell Shifu he's
got nothing to worry about.

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:17.393
- No, he doesn't.
- OK, I'll tell him that.

00:04:17.523 --> 00:04:19.438
Can we please go now?

00:04:34.975 --> 00:04:38.457
[crowd chanting]
Dragon Warrior! Dragon Warrior!

00:04:44.028 --> 00:04:46.117
Wait a second!

00:04:50.469 --> 00:04:52.732
I think there's been
a slight mistake.

00:04:52.863 --> 00:04:55.300
Everyone seems
to think that I'm, uh...

00:04:56.736 --> 00:05:01.480
Ooh! The Sacred Hall
of Warriors! No way!

00:05:01.611 --> 00:05:05.876
Look at this place. [gasping]

00:05:06.006 --> 00:05:10.272
Master Flying Rhino's armor,
with authentic battle damage!

00:05:10.402 --> 00:05:12.535
Whoa!

00:05:12.665 --> 00:05:14.493
The Sword of Heroes!

00:05:14.624 --> 00:05:17.496
Said to be so sharp you can
cut yourself just by looking.

00:05:17.627 --> 00:05:19.063
Ow!

00:05:19.194 --> 00:05:22.588
[gasping] The Invisible
Trident of Destiny!

00:05:24.111 --> 00:05:27.680
I've only seen paintings
of that painting.

00:05:27.811 --> 00:05:30.857
[giddy laughter]

00:05:32.337 --> 00:05:35.210
[gasps] No!

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:38.996
Oh, ho, ho, ho, ho!
The legendary Urn
of Whispering Warriors.

00:05:39.126 --> 00:05:42.608
Said to contain the souls
of the entire Tenshu Army.

00:05:45.829 --> 00:05:47.091
Hello.

00:05:47.222 --> 00:05:49.267
[Shifu] Have you
finished sight-seeing?

00:05:49.398 --> 00:05:51.443
Sorry, I should have
come to see you first.

00:05:51.574 --> 00:05:53.532
- My patience is wearing thin.
- Oh.

00:05:53.663 --> 00:05:56.361
Well, I mean, it's not
like you were going anywhere.

00:05:56.492 --> 00:05:58.885
- Would you turn around?
- Sure.

00:05:59.016 --> 00:06:02.498
Hey. How's it going?
How do you get 5,000...
Master Shifu!

00:06:02.628 --> 00:06:04.413
- Oh!
- [moaning emanating from urn]

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.850
Someone... broke that.

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:09.461
But I'm gonna fix it.
Do you have some...

00:06:10.288 --> 00:06:11.637
...glue?

00:06:12.682 --> 00:06:15.380
Ow! I have a splinter.

00:06:15.511 --> 00:06:18.514
So you're the legendary
Dragon Warrior, hmm?

00:06:18.644 --> 00:06:21.778
- Uh, I guess so.
- Wrong!

00:06:21.908 --> 00:06:23.258
You are not the Dragon Warrior.

00:06:23.388 --> 00:06:25.434
You will never be the
Dragon Warrior until...

00:06:25.564 --> 00:06:28.524
...you have learned the secret
of the Dragon Scroll.

00:06:28.654 --> 00:06:30.700
Whoa.

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:33.180
So, how does this work?

00:06:33.311 --> 00:06:36.009
Do you have a ladder,
or a trampoline, or...?

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:38.882
[chuckles]
You think it's that easy?

00:06:39.012 --> 00:06:41.319
That I'm just gonna
hand you the secret

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:43.408
- to limitless power?
- No, I...

00:06:43.539 --> 00:06:46.672
One must first master
the highest level of kung fu.

00:06:46.803 --> 00:06:50.589
And that is clearly impossible
if that one is someone like you.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:53.549
- Someone like me?
- Yes, look at you!

00:06:53.679 --> 00:06:56.595
- This fat butt! Flabby arms!
- Ouch!

00:06:56.726 --> 00:06:58.945
Those are sensitive
in the flabby parts.

00:06:59.076 --> 00:07:01.818
- And this ridiculous belly.
- Hey!

00:07:01.948 --> 00:07:05.343
And utter disregard
for personal hygiene.

00:07:05.474 --> 00:07:07.606
Now, wait a minute.
That's uncalled for.

00:07:07.737 --> 00:07:10.174
Don't stand that close.
I can smell your breath.

00:07:10.305 --> 00:07:12.045
Listen,
Oogway said I was...

00:07:12.176 --> 00:07:14.874
The Wuxi Finger Hold.
Not the Wuxi Finger Hold!

00:07:15.005 --> 00:07:17.529
Oh, you know this hold?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:20.358
Developed by Master Wuxi
in the Third Dynasty. Yes.

00:07:20.489 --> 00:07:23.274
Oh. Then you know what happens
when I flex my pinky.

00:07:23.405 --> 00:07:26.669
- [gasping] No, no!
- You know the hardest
part of this?

00:07:26.799 --> 00:07:30.760
The hardest part
is cleaning up afterwards.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:32.849
OK, OK, take it easy.

00:07:32.979 --> 00:07:35.330
Now listen closely,
panda.

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:38.550
Oogway may have picked you,
but when I'm through with you,

00:07:38.681 --> 00:07:43.773
I promise you, you're going to
wish he hadn't! Are we clear?

00:07:43.903 --> 00:07:46.950
Yeah, we're clear.
We're clear. We're so clear.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:50.910
Good. [chuckles]
I can't wait to get started.

